---
component: lamp
params:
  keeper: { type: string, default: "The inspector" }
  glass: { type: { enum: [steady, guttering] }, default: steady }
---

## Lamp

@narrator: {{@keeper}} lights the lamp.
<match subject="@glass">
  <when is="steady">
    @narrator: Steady.
  </when>
  <when is="guttering">
    @narrator: Guttering.
  </when>
</match>
